  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.07 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Barbering, Cosmetology, and Esthetics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.07 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Barbering, Cosmetology, and Esthetics. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.7, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of barbering, cosmetology, and esthetics under RSA 313-A:\n\nTable 1002.7 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Barbering, Cosmetology, and Esthetics\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nBarber, cosmetologist, esthetician, manicurist, or master barber personal license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $55\n\nTanning facility registration application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $170\n\nBarber, cosmetologist, esthetic, manicurist, or master barber apprentice certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 2 years | $55\n\nBarber, cosmetologist, esthetic, manicurist, or master barber instructor license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $82\n\nBarber shop instructor, cosmetology shop instructor, esthetic shop instructor, manicurist shop instructor, or master barber shop instructor license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $82\n\nShop license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nSchool license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $346\n\nSource. #13335, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-26-22; ss #13420, eff 8-8-22; ss by #13703, eff 8-1-23 (formerly Plc 1002.06); ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
